#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:1
msgid "Overview of the timeline docker."
msgstr "Pregled zloženega okna časovnice."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:12
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animacija"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:12
msgid "Timeline"
msgstr "Časovnica"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:12
msgid "Frame"
msgstr "Sličica"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:17
msgid "Animation Timeline Docker"
msgstr "Zloženo okno Časovnica animacije"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:19
msgid ""
"The :dfn:`Animation Timeline Docker` is at the heart of :program:`Krita`'s "
"raster animation tools, providing everything you need to create, edit and "
"preview traditional hand-drawn animations."
msgstr ""
":dfn:`Zloženo okno Časovnica animacije` je v središču orodij za rastrsko "
"animacijo programa :program:`Krita`, ki zagotavljajo vse, kar potrebujete za "
"ustvarjanje, urejanje in predogled tradicionalnih ročno risanih animacij."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:29
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pregled"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:31
msgid ""
"As shown in the image above, Krita's Animation Timeline Docker can be "
"thought of as different sections:"
msgstr ""
"Kot je prikazano na zgornji sliki, si lahko zloženo okno Časovnica animacije "
"v Kriti zamislimo kot razdeljenega na različne odseke:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:33
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":dfn:`Utilities` -- The left side of the toolbar gives animators quick "
"access to all of the widgets that are critical to their workflow; :dfn:"
"`transport controls` (previous, play/pause, stop and next buttons), a frame "
"counter, preview controls (speed and drop frames), and buttons for quickly "
"creating new frames and deleting unwanted ones."
msgstr ""
":d fn:'Utilities' -- Leva stran orodne vrstice animatorjem omogoča hiter "
"dostop do vseh pripomočkov, ki so kritični za njihov potek dela; :d "
"fn:'transport controls' (prejšnji, predvajanje/premor, ustavitev in "
"naslednji gumbi), števec okvirja, kontrolniki za predogled (hitrost in "
"okvirji za spuščanje) in gumbi za hitro ustvarjanje novih okvirjev in "
"brisanje nezaželenih."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:35
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":dfn:`Settings` -- While all of the high-traffic controls are presented "
"directly, the right end of the toolbar also contains buttons for opening "
"submenus for things like :ref:`onion_skin_docker` and settings that you can "
"generally set and forget (for example: playback range, frame rate and "
"autokey mode)."
msgstr ""
":d fn:'Nastavitve' -- Medtem ko so vsi kontrolniki z visokim prometom "
"predstavljeni neposredno, desni konec orodne vrstice vsebuje tudi gumbe za "
"odpiranje podmenijev za stvari, kot so :ref:'onion_skin_docker' in "
"nastavitve, ki jih lahko na splošno nastavite in pozabite (na primer: obseg "
"predvajanja, hitrost okvirja in način samodejnega vklopa)."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:37
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":dfn:`Layer List` -- This area contains some subset of the layers of your "
"current document. Similar to the :ref:`layer_docker`, each layer has various "
"properties that can also be toggled here (visibility, locking, onion skins, "
"etc.).  While the currently active layer is always shown here, layers can "
"also be \"pinned\" to the timeline using the pin button to the left of each "
"layer's name, the :guilabel:`Pin to Timeline` menu action, or the :guilabel:"
"`Pin Existing Layer` submenu so they will be visible even when inactive."
msgstr ""
":d fn:'Layer List' -- To področje vsebuje nekaj podskupin plasti trenutnega "
"dokumenta. Podobno kot na :ref:'layer_docker', ima vsaka plast različne "
"lastnosti, ki jih je mogoče preklopiti tudi tukaj (vidnost, zaklepanje, "
"čemažne kože itd.).  Medtem ko je trenutno aktivna plast vedno prikazana "
"tukaj, je mogoče plasti tudi \"pripeti\" na časovnico s pomočjo gumba pin na "
"levi strani imena vsake plasti, menisko dejanje :guilabel:'Pin to Timeline' "
"ali :guilabel:'Pin Existing Layer' podmeni, tako da bodo vidni tudi pri "
"neaktivnosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Depending on your preference, newly created paint layers can start pinned or "
"unpinned by setting the :guilabel:`Automatically pin new layers to timeline` "
"option in :guilabel:`Settings --> Configure Krita... --> General --> "
"Miscellaneous`."
msgstr ""
"Glede na vašo preferenco se lahko novo ustvarjene barvne plasti začnejo "
"pripeti ali odpele tako, da nastavite možnost :guilabel:'Samodejno pripni "
"nove plasti na časovnico' v :guilabel:'Nastavitve --> Konfiguriraj Krita... "
"--> Splošno --> Razno'."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:42
msgid "Active Layer:"
msgstr "Dejavna plast:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:45
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The :dfn:`active layer` is the layer that you're currently able to edit or "
"draw on, shown as a highlighted row in the layer list. |mouseleft| a layer "
"within the layer list will make it the currently active layer."
msgstr ""
":d fn:'aktivna plast' je plast, ki jo trenutno lahko urejate ali narišete, "
"prikazana kot označena vrstica na seznamu plasti. |mouseleft| plast znotraj "
"seznama plasti jo bo naredila trenutno aktivno plast."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:46
msgid "Layer Menu:"
msgstr "Meni Plasti:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:49
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A small menu for manipulating :dfn:`animated layers` at the top left of the "
"layer list. You can create new layers, remove existing ones, as well as pin "
"or unpin the active layer. (This menu also shows up when |mouseright| on "
"layer headers inside of the Layer List.)"
msgstr ""
"Majhen meni za :d fn:'animirane plasti' na zgornjem levem kotu seznama "
"plasti. Ustvarite lahko nove plasti, odstranite obstoječe ter pripnete ali "
"odpnete aktivno plast. (Ta meni se prikaže tudi || v glavah plasti znotraj "
"seznama plasti.)"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:50
msgid "Audio Menu:"
msgstr "Meni Zvok:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Another small menu at the top of the layer list for animating along with "
"audio sources. This is also where you can open or close audio sources and "
"control output volume/muting."
msgstr ""
"Še en majhen meni na vrhu seznama plasti za animacijo skupaj z avdio viri. "
"To je tudi, kjer lahko odprete ali zaprete zvočne vire in nadzorujete "
"glasnost/izklop izhoda."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:54
msgid "Zoom Handle:"
msgstr "Ročica povečave:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This special widget allows you to zoom in and out on the frame table, "
"centered around the current frame time. |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ drag` from "
"within the zoom handle controls the zoom level."
msgstr ""
"Ta posebni widget vam omogoča, da povečate in pomanjšate tabelo okvirja, "
"centrirano okoli trenutnega časa okvirja. |mouseleft| :kbd:'+ povlecite' iz "
"ročico za povečave nadzoruje raven povečave."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:59
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":dfn:`Frame Table` -- The :dfn:`frame table` is a large grid of cells which "
"can either hold a single keyframe or be empty. Each row of the frame table "
"represents an :dfn:`animated layer` and each column represents a :dfn:`frame "
"time`. Just like the layer list, the active layer is highlighted across the "
"entire frame table. For those who are familiar with pen-and-paper animation, "
"you can think of the frame table as Krita's :dfn:`dope sheet` or time sheet."
msgstr ""
":d fn:'Frame Table' -- :d fn:'frame table' je veliko omrežje celic, ki lahko "
"držijo en ključni okvir ali pa so prazne. Vsaka vrstica tabele okvirja "
"predstavlja :d fn:'animirana plast' in vsak stolpec predstavlja :d fn:'frame "
"time'. Tako kot na seznamu plasti je aktivna plast označena po celotni "
"tabeli okvirjev. Za tiste, ki so seznanjeni z animacijo peresa in papirja, "
"lahko o mizi okvirjev pomislite kot na Kritino :d fn:'dope sheet' ali "
"časovni list."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It's important to understand that frame timings are not based on units of "
"time like seconds, but on :dfn:`frames`, which can then be played back at "
"any speed, depending on the animation's :dfn:`frame rate` and :dfn:`play "
"speed` settings."
msgstr ""
"Pomembno je razumeti, da časovni okviri ne temeljijo na časovnih enotah, kot "
"so sekunde, temveč na :d fn:'frames', ki se lahko nato predvajajo z vsako "
"hitrostjo, odvisno od nastavitev animacije :d fn:'frame rate' in :d fn:'play "
"speed'."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:63
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Keyframes can be moved around the timeline by |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ drag` "
"shortcut from one slot to another, even across layers. Furthermore, holding "
"the :kbd:`Ctrl` key while dragging creates a copy, and holding the :kbd:"
"`Alt` key while dragging creates a clone frame. Finally, |mouseright| "
"anywhere in the frame table will bring up a context menu for adding, "
"removing, copying, pasting or adjusting timing."
msgstr ""
"Keyframes lahko premaknete okoli časovnice |mouseleft| :kbd:'+ povlecite' "
"bližnjico iz ene reže v drugo, tudi čez plasti. Poleg tega držanje ključa :"
"kbd:'Ctrl' med vlečenjem ustvari kopijo in držanje ključa :kbd:'Alt' med "
"vlečenjem ustvari okvir klona. Končno || kjerkoli v tabeli okvirja bo na "
"voljo kontekstni meni za dodajanje, odstranjevanje, kopiranje, lepljenje ali "
"prilagajanje časovnega razporeda."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:66
msgid "Active Keyframe"
msgstr "Dejavna ključna sličica"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Right now, it's only possible to view and draw on one keyframe at a time. "
"This is known as the :dfn:`active keyframe`, and is represented on the frame "
"table as a block filled with diagonal stripes. Often, in simple animations, "
"the active keyframe will be the frame on the active layer that is on or just "
"before the current time. However, if the active keyframe has one or more :"
"term:`clone frames` all drawing, painting and editing will also affect all "
"of its clones."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno si je mogoče ogledati in risati samo en ključni okvir naenkrat. To "
"je znano kot :d fn:\"aktivni ključni okvir\" in je na tabeli okvirja "
"predstavljen kot blok, poln diagonalnih črt. Pogosto bo v preprostih "
"animacijah aktivni ključni okvir okvir na aktivni plasti, ki je na ali pred "
"trenutnim časom. Če pa ima aktivni ključni okvir enega ali več :"
"izraz:'klonski okvirji' bodo vplivali tudi na vse njegove klone."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:70
msgid "Clone frames"
msgstr "Kloniraj ključne sličice"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A :dfn:`clone frame` of a keyframe is a reference to that keyframe at a "
"different position. Clone frames share the exact same image data under the "
"hood, and will have the same diagonal markings as the active frame when an "
"active frame with clone frames is selected."
msgstr ""
"A :d fn:'klon okvir' keyframe je sklicevanje na ta keyframe na drugem "
"položaju. Klonski okvirji delijo enake slikovne podatke pod pokrovom in "
"imajo enake diagonalne oznake kot aktivni okvir, ko je izbran aktivni okvir "
"s kloni."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:73
msgid "Duplicate keyframe"
msgstr "Podvoji ključno sličico"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:75
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Not to be confused with :term:`Clone Frames`, a duplicate frame is merely "
"the :term:`Active Keyframe` copied and pasted as a separate :term:"
"`Keyframe`. Where clone frames will automatically duplicate the changes you "
"make to them to each cloned frame, a duplicated frame is just another "
"keyframe that happens to have the same content as the source."
msgstr ""
"Da se ne zmešamo z :izraz:'Klon okvirji', je podvojeni okvir zgolj :"
"izraz:'Active Keyframe' kopiran in prilepen kot ločen :izraz:'Keyframe'. "
"Kjer bodo klonski okvirji samodejno podvojil spremembe, ki jih naredite v "
"vsakem klonljenem okvirju, je podvojeni okvir le še en ključni okvir, ki ima "
"povsem enako vsebino kot vir."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:76
msgid "Current Selection"
msgstr "Trenutni izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Frames highlighted in orange represent a selection or multiple selections. "
"While multiple frames are selected, |mouseright| anywhere in the frame table "
"will bring up a context menu that will allow for adding and removing "
"keyframes or holds within the current selection. It's also possible to have "
"multiple separate (non-contiguous) selections if needed."
msgstr ""
"Okvirji, označeni v oranžni barvi, predstavljajo izbor ali več izborov. "
"Medtem ko je izbranih več okvirjev, |mouseright| kjerkoli v tabeli okvirja "
"bo na voljo kontekstni meni, ki bo omogočal dodajanje in odstranjevanje "
"ključnih okvirjev ali držal znotraj trenutne izbire. Po potrebi je mogoče "
"imeti tudi več ločenih (neskladnih) selekcij."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:81
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Painting always happens *only* on the :term:`active keyframe`, which is not "
"necessarily part of your current selection on the timeline!"
msgstr ""
"Slikanje se vedno dogaja *samo* na :izraz:'aktivni keyframe', ki ni nujno "
"del vašega trenutnega izbora na časovnici!"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:83
msgid "Keyframe"
msgstr "Ključna sličica"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:86
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In :program:`Krita`, we call the images that make up your animation :dfn:"
"`keyframes`. Each keyframe can also be assigned a :term:`Color Label`, as a "
"matter of personal organization and workflow."
msgstr ""
"V :p rogramu:'Krita', imenujemo slike, ki iznašajo vašo animacijo :d "
"fn:'keyframes'. Vsakemu keyframeu je mogoče dodeliti tudi :term:'Color "
"Label', kot stvar osebne organizacije in poteka dela."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:87
msgid "Blank Keyframe"
msgstr "Prazna ključna sličica"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:89
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Within the frame table, keyframes that contain drawings are displayed as "
"*filled blocks* within a cell, while a :dfn:`blank keyframe` is shown as a "
"*hollow outline*. Unlike some other tools, :program:`Krita` automatically "
"holds each keyframe until the next keyframe on that layer; these :dfn:"
"`holds` are shown as a *colored line* that's drawn across all held frames."
msgstr ""
"V tabeli okvirjev so ključni okvirji, ki vsebujejo risbe, prikazani kot "
"*napolnjeni bloki* znotraj celice, medtem ko je :d fn:'prazen okvir za "
"tipke' prikazan kot *votli oris*. Za razliko od nekaterih drugih orodij, :p "
"rogram:'Krita' samodejno drži vsak ključni okvir do naslednjega keyframe na "
"tej plasti; te :d fn:'holds' so prikazane kot *barvna črta* , ki je narisana "
"po vseh držalih okvirjev."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:90
#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
#| msgid "Frame timing:"
msgid "Frame Timing Header"
msgstr "Časovna usklajenost sličic:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The frame timing header is a ruler at the top of the frame table. This "
"header is divided into small notched sections which are based on the "
"current :dfn:`frame rate` (set in the animation settings submenu at the "
"right end of the toolbar). While each frame is marked with a single line, "
"each second is marked by a subtle double-line. Major notches are also marked "
"by a frame number."
msgstr ""
"Glava časovnega razporeda okvirja je ravnilo na vrhu tabele okvirja. Ta "
"glava je razdeljena na majhne zareze, ki temeljijo na trenutni :d fn:'frame "
"rate' (nastavljeno v podmeni nastavitve animacije na desni strani orodne "
"vrstice). Medtem ko je vsak okvir označen z eno vrstico, je vsaka sekunda "
"označena s subtilno dvojno črto. Večje zasjeke označuje tudi številka "
"okvirja."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:94
msgid "Cached Frames"
msgstr "Predpomnjene sličice"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:97
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The frame timing header also shows important information about which frames "
"are currently :dfn:`cached`. When something is said to be \"cached\", that "
"means that it is stored in your device's working memory (RAM) for extra fast "
"access. Cached frames are shown by the header with a small light-gray "
"rectangle in each column. While this information isn't always critical for "
"us artists, it's helpful to know that Krita is working behind the curtains "
"to cache our animation frames for the smoothest possible experience when "
"scrubbing through or playing back your animation."
msgstr ""
"Glava časovnega razporeda okvirja prikazuje tudi pomembne informacije o tem, "
"kateri okvirji so trenutno :d fn:\"predpomnjena\". Če se za nekaj reče, da "
"je »predpomnjena«, to pomeni, da je shranjeno v delovnem pomnilniku naprave "
"(RAM) za dodaten hiter dostop. Predpomnjene okvirje prikazuje glava z "
"majhnim svetlo sivim pravokotnikom v vsakem stolpcu. Medtem ko te "
"informacije niso vedno kritične za nas umetnike, je koristno vedeti, da "
"Krita dela za zavese za predpomnitev naših animacijskih okvirjev za čim bolj "
"gladko izkušnjo pri brskanju skozi ali igranje nazaj vaše animacije."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:98
msgid "Current Time Scrubber:"
msgstr "Časovni drsnik:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:101
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A highlighted column in the frame table which controls the current frame "
"time and, as such, what is currently displayed in the viewport."
msgstr ""
"Označeni stolpec v tabeli okvirja, ki nadzoruje trenutni čas okvirja in, kot "
"je to, kar je trenutno prikazano v pogledu."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:102
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Scrollbars"
msgid "Zoomable Scrollbar"
msgstr "Drsniki"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:105
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Not only can the scrollbars on the Animation Timeline Docker be used to :dfn:"
"`pan` the frame table by dragging left and right, it can also be used to "
"quickly :dfn:`zoom` in and out by dragging up and down. Pan and zoom in one "
"flick of a wrist!"
msgstr ""
"Ne samo, da se lahko drsna trakovi na časovnici animacije uporabijo za :d "
"fn:'pan' tabelo okvirja z vlečenjem levo in desno, lahko se uporablja tudi "
"za hitro :d fn:'zoom' v in ven z vlečenjem navzgor in dol. Ponev in zoom v "
"enem flick zapestju!"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:107
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":dfn:`Onion Skins Docker` -- While technically a separate docker, the :ref:"
"`onion_skin_docker` is used in conjunction with the Animation Timeline "
"docker to help animators see how their animation changes between neighboring "
"keyframes. The :guilabel:`onion skins menu` button on the Animation Timeline "
"Docker can be used to quickly toggle the visibility of the Onion Skins "
"Docker."
msgstr ""
":d fn:'Onion Skins Docker' -- Medtem ko je tehnično ločen docker, se "
"uporablja :ref:'onion_skin_docker' v povezavi s časovnico animacije, da bi "
"animatorji videli, kako se njihova animacija spreminja med sosednjimi "
"ključnimi okvirji. Gumb menija :guilabel:'onion skins' na dockerju za "
"časovnico animacije se lahko uporablja za hitro preklapljanje vidnosti "
"dockerja za čefute kože."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:111
msgid "Animating"
msgstr "Animiranje"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:113
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In order to begin animating with :program:`Krita`, we first need to turn our "
"paint layer into an :dfn:`animated layer` by adding our first :term:"
"`keyframe`. In our case we will start with a :term:`blank keyframe`, but if "
"you've already drawn something on the paint layer and would like to transfer "
"it to your new keyframe you can create a :term:`duplicate keyframe` instead."
msgstr ""
"Da bi začeli z animacijo z :p rogram:'Krita', moramo najprej spremeniti našo "
"barvo plast v :d fn:'animirani sloj' z dodajanjem našega prvega :"
"izraz:'keyframe'. V našem primeru bomo začeli z :term:'blank keyframe', "
"vendar če ste že nekaj narisal na plast barve in bi ga radi prenesli na svoj "
"novi keyframe lahko ustvarite :term:'duplicate keyframe' namesto tega."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:115
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To make a new, blank keyframe, |mouseright| any square on the timeline "
"docker and select :guilabel:`Create Blank Frame`. A blank frame (one that "
"you haven't yet drawn anything in) appears as a *hollow outline* instead of "
"a solid box, making that frame active and drawing on the canvas will make it "
"appear as a *solid, colored rectangle*. To move a keyframe around, you can "
"drag and drop it into another empty frame slot, even across animation layers."
msgstr ""
"Če želite narediti nov, prazen keyframe, |mouseright| vsak kvadrat na "
"časovnem pasu in izberite :guilabel:'Create Blank Frame'. Prazen okvir "
"(tisti, v ki še niste ničesar narisal) se pojavi kot *votli oris* namesto "
"trdne škatle, zaradi česar bo okvir aktiven in risba na platnu bo videti kot "
"*trden, obarvan pravokotnik*. Če želite premakniti ključni okvir, ga lahko "
"povlečete in spustite v drugo režo praznega okvirja, tudi po plasteh "
"animacije."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:117
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The currently selected layer will automatically be shown on the timeline. "
"However, while animating you may find that you want to keep another layer "
"\"pinned\", making it visible in the Animation Timeline Docker regardless of "
"which layer is selected. There are a few ways to do this in Krita, but it "
"doesn't get any simpler than |mouseleft| on the little pushpin icon next to "
"the layer's name."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno izbrana plast bo samodejno prikazana na časovnici. Med animacijo pa "
"boste morda ugotovili, da želite ohraniti drugo plast \"pripeto\", zaradi "
"česar je vidna v dockerju časovnice animacije, ne glede na to, katera plast "
"je izbrana. V Kriti je nekaj načinov za to, vendar ne more biti enostavneje "
"kot |mouseleft| na malo pushpin ikono poleg imena plasti."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:119
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It's not much of an animation with only one frame, so to add another new "
"frame you can do the same thing we did last time by selecting :guilabel:"
"`Create Blank Frame` from the |mouseright| menu or by double- |mouseleft| on "
"a particular frame slot. For the sake of this lesson, however, we will mix "
"it up by creating a duplicate keyframe by scrubbing to a different *time* "
"and press the :guilabel:`Create Duplicate Keyframe` button on toolbar at the "
"top of the Animation Timeline Docker."
msgstr ""
"To ni veliko animacija z enim okvirjem, tako da dodati še en nov okvir lahko "
"storite isto, kot smo nazadnje naredili tako, da izberete :guilabel:'Create "
"Blank Frame' iz |mouseright| ali z dvojno |mouseleft| na določeni reži "
"okvirja. Za dobro te lekcije pa jo bomo zmešali z ustvarjanjem podvojenega "
"keyframea tako, da izribamo na drug *čas* in pritisnemo gumb :"
"guilabel:'Create Duplicate Keyframe' na orodni vrstici na vrhu dockerja "
"časovnice animacije."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As you can see, there are quick a few convenient ways to add or remove "
"keyframes from your animation in Krita, depending on your personal "
"preference, input devices and workflow!"
msgstr ""
"Kot lahko vidite, obstaja hitro nekaj priročnih načinov za dodajanje ali "
"odstranjevanje ključnih okvirjev iz animacije v Kriti, odvisno od vaše "
"osebne nastavitve, vhodnih naprav in poteka dela!"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:123
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now that we have more than one keyframe, we can do different drawings in "
"each and play back our simple animation by press the :guilabel:`Play/Pause` "
"button on the toolbar at the top of the docker. Another crucial technique "
"for animating is manually switching between frames at your own pace to "
"inspect the frame-by-frame movement of your animation as you work, also "
"known as \"scrubbing\". Like everything else, we've made sure that there are "
"a few different ways to scrub through you animation, but one of my favorites "
"is to simply |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ drag` between different times on the :term:"
"`Frame Timing Header` at the top of the frame table."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj, ko imamo več kot en keyframe, lahko naredimo različne risbe v vsaki in "
"predvajati nazaj našo preprosto animacijo s pritiskom na :guilabel:'Play /"
"Pause' gumb na orodni vrstici na vrhu docker. Druga ključna tehnika za "
"animacijo je ročno preklapljanje med okvirji po lastnem koraku, da se "
"preveri gibanje animacije po okvirju med delom, znano tudi kot \"scrubbing"
"\". Tako kot vse drugo, smo se tudi mi povsem prepričali, da obstaja nekaj "
"različnih načinov za brskanje po vas animaciji, ena mojih najljubših pa je, "
"da preprosto |mouseleft| :kbd:'+ povlecite' med različnimi časi :term:'Frame "
"Timing Header' na vrhu tabele okvirjev."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:125
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I know that's a lot of info to digest, but all you really need to know to "
"get started is how to create new keyframes and scrub through your animation "
"to check your progress. From there, all that's left is the hard but "
"rewarding work of drawing lots and lots (and lots) of animation frames!"
msgstr ""
"Vem, da je veliko informacij za prebavo, ampak vse, kar morate vedeti, da "
"začnete je, kako ustvariti nove keyframes in scrub skozi animacijo, da "
"preverite svoj napredek. Od tam je ostalo le težko, a nagrajevanje dela "
"risanje lotov in veliko (in veliko) animacijskih okvirjev!"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:129
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "Namigi"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are a couple subtle features built into the docker's transport "
"controls that you might find useful. For example, press the :guilabel:`Stop` "
"button *while your animation is playing* will jump back to whatever frame "
"you started playing from, and press it again *when your animation is not "
"playing* will jump back to the first frame of your animation. Similarly, "
"the :guilabel:`next keyframe` button will jump the selection to the next "
"available keyframe on the active layer, but *if there is no next keyframe on "
"that layer it will use the timing of your animation to estimate where you "
"may want to place your next keyframe, and jump to that position.* While a "
"bit advanced, nuances like this mean that the Animation Timeline Docker's "
"buttons (and keybind-able actions) almost always do something useful for "
"animators."
msgstr ""
"Obstaja nekaj subtilno funkcije vgrajene v docker's transportne kontrole, ki "
"bi vam morda koristile. Na primer, pritisnite gumb :guilabel:'Stop' *medtem "
"ko se animacija predvaja* bo skočila nazaj na kateri koli okvir, iz katere "
"ste začeli igrati, in ga znova pritisnite *ko se animacija ne predvaja* bo "
"skočila nazaj na prvi okvir animacije. Podobno bo gumb :guilabel:'next "
"keyframe' preskočil izbor na naslednji razpoložljivi keyframe na aktivni "
"plasti, vendar *če na tej plasti ni naslednjega keyframea, bo uporabil čas "
"animacije, da oceni, kje boste morda želeli namestiti svoj naslednji ključni "
"okvir in skočiti na ta položaj.* Medtem ko nekoliko napredno,  To pomeni, da "
"gumbi Animation Timeline Docker (in dejanja, ki so v kombinaciji s tipkami), "
"skoraj vedno naredijo nekaj uporabnega za animatorje."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:133
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It's possible to add multiple keyframes by |mouseright| inside the frame "
"table and selecting the :menuselection:`Keyframes --> Insert Multiple "
"Keyframes` pop-up submenu item. With this option you can specify the number "
"of frames to add with the option of built in timing for quickly creating a "
"series of 1s, 2s, 3s, etc. These settings are saved between uses."
msgstr ""
"Mogoče je dodati več ključnih okvirjev s |mouseright| znotraj tabele okvirja "
"in izberite element pojavnega podmenija :menuselection:'Keyframes --> Vstavi "
"več ključnihframov'. S to možnostjo lahko določite število okvirjev, ki jih "
"želite dodati z možnostjo vgrajene v časovni razpored za hitro ustvarjanje "
"serije 1s, 2s, 3s, itd. Te nastavitve so shranjene med uporabami."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:135
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can also change the color of keyframes within the frame table so that "
"you can easily identify important frames or distinguish between different "
"sections of your animation. The current color selection is remembered for "
"new frames so that you can easily make a set of colored frames and then "
"switch to another color. (By the way, it's even possible to quickly jump "
"between frames of the same color by assigning a keyboard shortcut to :"
"guilabel:`Previous/Next Matching Keyframe`.)"
msgstr ""
"Spremenite lahko tudi barvo ključnih okvirjev znotraj tabele okvirjev, tako "
"da lahko preprosto prepoznate pomembne okvirje ali razlikujete med "
"različnimi odseki animacije. Trenutna izbira barv je zapomnjena po novih "
"okvirih, tako da lahko enostavno naredite nabor barvnih okvirjev in nato "
"preklopite na drugo barvo. (Mimogrede, to je celo mogoče hitro skočiti med "
"okvirji iste barve, tako da dodelite bližnjico na tipkovnici na :"
"guilabel:'Previous/Next Matching Keyframe'.)"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:137
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"|mouseright| within the :term:`Frame Timing Header` instead of the frame "
"table gives you access to a few more option which allow you to add or remove "
"entire columns of frames or holds at a time, as well as reset your animation "
"cache if needed. For example, selecting the :menuselection:`Keyframe Columns "
"--> Insert Keyframe Column Left` pop-up submenu item will add new frames to "
"each layer that's currently visible in the Timeline Docker."
msgstr ""
"|mouseright| znotraj :term:'Frame Timeing Header' namesto okvirne tabele vam "
"omogoča dostop do nekaj več možnosti, ki vam omogočajo, da dodate ali "
"odstranite celotne stolpce okvirjev ali drži naenkrat, kot tudi ponastavite "
"predpomnilnik animacije, če je potrebno. Če izberete na primer :"
"menuselection:'Keyframe Columns --> Insert Keyframe Column Left' element "
"pojavnega podmenija »Keyframe Left« bo vsaki plasti, ki je trenutno vidna v "
"dockerju časovnice, dodali nove okvirje."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_timeline.rst:146
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To delete frames, |mouseright| the frame and press :guilabel:`Remove "
"Keyframe`. This will delete all selected frames. Similarly, selecting :"
"guilabel:`Remove Frame and Pull` will delete the selected frames and pull or "
"shift all subsequent frames back/left as much as possible."
msgstr ""
"Če želite izbrisati okvirje, |mouseright| okvir in pritisnite :"
"guilabel:'Odstrani keyframe'. S tem boste izbrisali vse izbrane okvirje. "
"Podobno bo izbira :guilabel:'Remove Frame and Pull' izbrisala izbrane "
"okvirje in potegnila ali premaknila vse naslednje okvirje nazaj/levo, "
"kolikor je mogoče."

